# Typing, Ctrl->Command mapping, Home / App Switcher / Spotlight shortcuts and the Ctrl+Alt escape hatch.
expect Control: capture on
expect Lab: PASS \[Lab iPhone 1\] text 'Hello lab 123'
expect Lab: \[Lab iPhone 1\] shortcut Command\+c
expect Lab: \[Lab iPhone 1\] Home
expect Lab: \[Lab iPhone 1\] App Switcher
expect Lab: \[Lab iPhone 1\] Spotlight
expect Control: capture off
expect-not Lab: FAIL
0     video ../fixtures/portrait.h265
1500  focus
2000  click 0.5 0.5
2600  type Hello lab 123
4800  expect-text Hello lab 123
5000  key ctrl+c
5600  key ctrl+1
6600  key ctrl+2
7600  key ctrl+3
8600  key ctrl+alt
9500  quit
